  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial support to the PWB of the OECD DAC - EvalNet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Switzerlands support to the Development Assistance Committee (DAC) of the Organization for Economic Cooperation and Development (OECD) aims at maximizing the impact and effectiveness of international development cooperation towards achieving the Sustainable Development Goals in developing countries, ensuring that no one is left behind. Through knowledge sharing, joint learning and standards setting, the DAC contributes to enhance the coordination and coherence of international cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
